      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Jonathan Crow and Philip Chiu take the TSM stage by storm with a series of five concerts comprising a complete cycle of Beethoven’s Sonatas for Piano and Violin. Each show also features a world premiere – don't miss these! "
