        "@value": "TSM Community Showcase - Toronto Summer Music"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Come out for a casual and fun day of performances featuring participants in the TSM Community Program! The Community Program welcomes enthusiastic amateur musicians from around the world who spend a week in Toronto making music with each other and TSM Academy Mentors. Concert details to be announced in July. "
      }
